    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "9a0fc60e-3ac6-46ac-8d2a-94eac673410a",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Murk These Fools Pt. 3",
        "Location": "LOCATION_OPULENT_STINGRAY",
        "PublicId": "126268818342",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository cee4e428-1efb-42ef-8eb5-763822781738).Image",
        "Description": "Last summer I visited Haven for a well deserved vacation from my very demanding, high powered job. I&apos;m a very important person, as you know. These jackwagons were in the cabana next door, and were making an awful lot of noise. One night I met this fine ass honey down by the pool, and took her back to my spot for some youknaaamean heh haaaa. Anyway, I ended not gettin&apos; any trim because she was turned off by all the noise next door. Murk these fools for dick blockin&apos; me.",
